<title>USA: Enserch Exploration names Addy interim CEO.</title>
<headline>Enserch Exploration names Addy interim CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enserch Exploration Inc said Wednesday its board picked board member Frederick Addy to serve as interim chairman and chief executive officer while it searches for a replacement for former chairman and chief executive David Biegler.</p>
<p>The company said Biegler accepted a position with Texas Utilities Co, where he will start working after Texas Utilities merges with ENSERCH Corp. Enserch said the merger should be completed later this year.  </p>
<p>ENSERCH Corp owns 83 percent of Ensearch Exploration and has said it intends to spin off Enserch Exploration during the merger by distributing its shares of Enserch Exploration stock.</p>
</text>
